  "requirement_en": "Starts when you visit any of these locations: the mattress below the 'жопа' graffiti on the second floor of the Scav base on Customs / the top of the White Queen radar dome on Reserve / the bunker north of the Health Resort on Shoreline / the mattress on the large rock at the USEC camp on Woods",
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "BEAR 특수부대의 흔적 (보가티르 패치)",
      "title_en": "Traces of the BEAR special squad (Bogatyrs patch)",
      "map": null,
      "tip": "보가티르 패치를 주워 읽기. 네 곳 중 아무 데나: 세관 새 주유소 남서쪽 언덕 위 오두막 소파 / 삼림 화물 호송대 BRDM 옆 바닥 / 리저브 백색 킹 항공관제센터 위쪽 지붕 소포 위 / 등대 BEAR 캠프 침낭 위. ⚠ 패치는 나중에 등대지기에게 내야 하니 레이드 밖 퀘스트 인벤토리로 옮겨 두기.",
      "tip_en": "Pick up and read the Bogatyrs patch at any of four locations: the sofa in the cabin on the hill southwest of the new gas station on Customs / the ground beside the BRDM at the cargo convoy on Woods / a parcel on the upper roof of the White King airspace control center on Reserve / a sleeping bag at the BEAR camp on Lighthouse. ⚠ You will need to give the patch to Lightkeeper later, so move it to your off-raid quest inventory.",
      "steps": [
